# EmailJS Configuration for Direct Inbox Delivery
# 1. Sign up for free at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail connected to lohitha4219@gmail.com) -> Copy Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template with fields: {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{subject}}, {{message}} -> Copy Template ID
# 4. In Account Settings -> Copy Public Key
# 5. Create a .env file with these values:

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here

# Verified destination inbox
VITE_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=lohitha4219@gmail.com
